---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: page-random
pageTitle: 随机一条 — EVE 梗指南
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
permalink: "/random/index.html"
---
{%- set all = collections.memes -%}
{%- set slugs = all | slugsOf -%}
<section class="intro">
  <h1>随机翻一条</h1>
  <p>共 {{ all.length }} 条词条，每次打开随机挑一条。</p>
  <p><a class="big-link" href="{{ ('/m/' + slugs[0] + '/') | url }}" id="random-link">点这里翻一条 →</a></p>
</section>
<script>
  const slugs = {{ slugs | json | safe }};
  const a = document.getElementById("random-link");
  a.href = a.href.replace(/\/m\/[^/]+\//, "/m/" + slugs[Math.floor(Math.random() * slugs.length)] + "/");
</script>
